# ── Papers ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# arXiv sources for the formalized manuscripts (~90 MB of LaTeX + figures).
# Fetch them from arXiv rather than tracking them here, at the version the
# docstrings cite, each into papers/arXiv-<id>/:
#   1904.03590v4  On the Convergence Proof of AMSGrad and a New Version
#   1904.09237    On the Convergence of Adam and Beyond
#   2106.06981v2  Thinking Like Transformers
#   2305.05465v6  The emergence of clusters in self-attention dynamics
#   2310.16028v1  What Algorithms can Transformers Learn?
#                 A Study in Length Generalization
#   2312.10794v5  A mathematical perspective on Transformers
#   2410.06833v1  Dynamic metastability in the self-attention model
#   2411.04551v3  Measure-to-measure interpolation using Transformers
#   2411.04990v2  Clustering in Causal Attention Masking
#   2412.09080v3  On the number of modes of Gaussian kernel
#                 density estimators
#   2506.16055v3  Knee-Deep in C-RASP: A Transformer Depth Hierarchy
#   2508.09628v1  Attention's forward pass and Frank-Wolfe
#   2510.22026v2  Normalization in Attention Dynamics
#   2512.01868v4  The Mean-Field Dynamics of Transformers
#   2601.21366v2  Perceptrons and localization of attention's
#                 mean-field landscape
#   2601.22813v2  Quartet II: Accurate LLM Pre-Training in NVFP4
#                 by Improved Unbiased Gradient Estimation
#   2603.09078v1  Exclusive Self Attention
#   2604.01978v1  Homogenized Transformers
#   2605.09213v1  Kinetic theory for Transformers
#                 and the lost-in-the-middle phenomenon
/papers/

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Editors / OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# ── discrtree ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The tool's own state: the config, the index, the JSONL dumps and the
# fetched corpora.  Local to the machine, and reproducible with
# `dt init && dt fetch && dt dump && dt index`.
/.discrtree/
/discrtree.toml
/.claude/skills/discrtree/

# ── Experiments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/experiments/runs/
/experiments/*/runs/
